Have you looked at the documentation (Help -> on-line manuals in any 
version of S-Plus since 4, I think)?  What distribution do you want?  
The S language has a convention adopting a name like "norm" or "chisq" 
for a distribution, with a prefix of "d", "p", "q", and "r" for density, 
cumulative distribution ("probability"), quantile, and random numbers, 
respectively. 

hope  this helps.  spencer graves

