On Fri, 10 Oct 2003, Pedram Sendi wrote:

> I am using multinom (from the nnet library provided by V&R) for 
> conducting a multinomial ordinary logistic regression model of a 
> given response variable with three levels and several categorical and 
> continuous independent variables. I would also like to get a 
> confidence interval for the resulting odds ratios and the respective 
> p-values, as well as the p-values for possible interaction terms. 
