Thanks to Dimitris Rizopoulos who help me with this very good suggestion:

Dear Annaλle,

I think that you could use the "weights" argument of the lme function.

e.g.,

lme1 <- lme(fixed=Y~Time*Group, random=~1|Subject, weights=varIdent(form
=~1|Group), data=DF)

summary(lme1)
intervals(lme1, which="var-cov")

I hope this helps.

