MASS4 section 6.4 (and in earlier editions too).

>       Consider the following toy problem: 
> 
> DF <- data.frame(x=1:11, y=rep(0:1, length=11))
> fit <- lm(y~ns(x, 3), DF)
> DF2 <- data.frame(x=3:5)
> predict(fit, DF2)
