> different papers
>
> Rochon, J. (1998).  Application of GEE procedures for sample size
> calculations in repeated measures experiments.  Statistics in Medicine,
> 17, 1643-1658.
> Note: you can email Jim Rochon directly for SAS code.  He's now at Duke -
